      "body": "> I've changed the faucet refill transactions to have [random feerates](https://mempool.space/signet/tx/154e8836f586124eff2ace9c66eb5eb462f029ed2877479a897a348db8146631) rather than estimated feerates, so that might give the estimator a bit more data to work from in future.\n\n\nI checked the stats from 308345 to 309090, and this is still happening, I think\n\n<img width=\"1341\" height=\"713\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/976b0f60-7841-4086-95f4-f28f84c153a9\" />\n\nBlock Policy fee rate estimate recommendation at block height 309090 for confirmation target (1/2) was 452.9 sat/vB, while the signet mempool was almost empty. See the confirmed [block at that height](https://mempool.space/signet/block/0000000dcaf947f19215c82511e6737b4fc4938ab3d53ac183ec8cc834225def)",
